%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day04NewVoiceAnnouncement
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Attention. This channel is under new management, effective immediately.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Vladimir Syrnikov is no longer with the company. As of last night, to
      be precise.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: No need for concern. He was a contractor. A freelancer. Convenient,
      while he lasted.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You may refer to me as your new administrator. I've been sent to oversee
      this facility personally.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Let's be clear about something Vlad apparently never made clear enough.
      We are watching. All of you. Closely.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Every stamp. Every door left unlocked. Every... irregularity. Nothing
      goes unnoticed anymore.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Get back to work. I'll be listening.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5eca02ca38bc75f499ef9b47f92b8db2, type: 2}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
